hearing%20Factory\">Mammoth Shearing Factory</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Trade%20Quarter\">Trade Quarter</a> in <a href=\"#/wiki/Yalahar\">Yalahar</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Witches%27%20Cliff\">The Witches' Cliff</a> (only accessible during a <a href=\"#/quest/the-inquisition-quest\">quest</a>).\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-behaviour\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Behaviour\">Behaviour</span></h3>\n<p>\tThey can rarely transform you into a <a href=\"#/wiki/Green%20Frog\">Green Frog</a>.<br/><br/>A witch attacks from a distance.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div class=\"history-section\" id=\"w-creature-history\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-History\">History</span></h3>\n<p>Although the sprites for witch were implemented on Update 6.0, the first known spawns of this creature were probably only implemented with <a href=\"#/wiki/Green%20Claw%20Swamp\">Green Claw Swamp</a> on Update 6.1.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Loot\">Loot</span></h3>\n<p><small><i>Drop rates are estimated based on 39,193 samples <span class=\"loot-stats-link\">(Loot Statistics)</span>.</i></small> <small><i>Colour-coding is applied after 500 samples.</i></small><br/><small><i>Task column indicates items used in delivery tasks.</i></small>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"text-align:center; width:auto;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th></th>\n<th>Item</th>\n<th>Task</th>\n<th>Quantity</th>\n<th>Avg</th>\n<th data-sort-type=\"number\">%\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"loot-table-icon\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\"><img alt=\"Gold Coin\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gold_Coin_a5b511.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></span></td>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>1-40</td>\n<td>17.6</td>\n<td clas